{# Body fragment for the shared email layout; it is rendered on its own and handed to `email/basic.html.twig` as
   `body_main`. These emails are English only, so they carry no translations. #}
<p>Dear {{ firstName }},</p>
<p>
    Your payment of the membership fee has failed. Without payment of the membership fee, we cannot approve the
    membership. We kindly ask you to try again using the following link:
    <a href="{{ restartUrl }}" style="color: #C40000; text-decoration: none;" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow">{{ restartUrl }}</a>.
</p>
{% include 'partials/email/payment-alternatives.html.twig' %}
<p>
    With kind regards,
    <br>The board of GEWIS
</p>
